周廣","start":189,"end":191,"person_id":"1tq_584_98b","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-058-zhou-fang:p002","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-058-zhou-fang"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-huayi:p002:m0370","surface":"周廣","start":370,"end":372,"person_id":"1tq_584_98b","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-061-huayi:p002","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-061-huayi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family:p002:m0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"周廣","kind":"person","person_id":"1tq_584_98b","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family:p002","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-jinshu076-wang-014","person_id":"1tq_584_98b","title":"豫章太守","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-076","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family","source_id":"s-jinshu-076-wangyi-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family:p002","quote":"初，王敦左遷陶侃，使廙代為荊州。將吏馬俊、鄭攀等上書請留侃，敦不許。廙為俊等所襲，奔于江安。賊杜曾與俊、攀北迎第五猗以距廙。廙督諸軍討曾，又為曾所敗。敦命湘州刺史甘卓、豫章太守周廣等助廙擊曾，曾衆潰，廙得到州。廙性俊率，嘗從南下，旦自尋陽，迅風飛帆，暮至都，倚舫樓長嘯，神氣甚逸。王導謂庾亮曰：「世將為傷時識事。」亮曰：「正足舒其逸氣耳。」廙在州大誅戮侃時將佐，及征士皇甫方回，於是大失荊土之望，人情乖阻。帝乃征廙為輔國將軍，加散騎常侍。以母喪去職。服闋，拜征虜將軍，進左衛將軍。","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family:p002:m0088"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-jinshu076-wang-014:a001","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family:p002","start":84,"end":88,"surface":"豫章太守","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-076-wangyi-family:p002:m0088","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"只按本段任官、授爵或用稱；未知起訖不補。義熙末保留晚期原語，不選定某一年。未將疑缺平南將領字串補成平南將軍。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-058-zhou-fang:p002","text":"及元帝渡江，命參鎮東軍事。時有與訪同姓名者，罪當死，吏誤收訪，訪奮擊收者，數十人皆散走，而自歸於帝，帝不之罪。尋以爲揚烈將軍，領兵一千二百，屯尋陽鄂陵，與甘卓、趙誘討華軼。所統厲武將軍丁乾與軼所統武昌太守馮逸交通，訪收斬之。逸來攻訪，訪率眾擊破之。逸遁保柴桑，訪乘勝進討。軼遣其党王約、傅劄等萬餘人助逸，大戰於湓口，約等又敗。訪與甘卓等會於彭澤，與軼水軍將硃矩等戰，又敗之。軼將周廣燒城以應訪，軼眾潰，訪執軼，斬之，遂平江州。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":70,"last_line":70,"raw_start":5785,"raw_end":6004,"raw_character_offsets":[5787,5788,5789,5790,5791,5792,5793,5794,5795,5796,5797,5798,5799,5800,5801,5802,5803,5804,5805,5806,5807,5808,5809,5810,5811,5812,5813,5814,5815,5816,5817,5818,5819,5820,5821,5822,5823,5824,5825,5826,5827,5828,5829,5830,5831,5832,5833,5834,5835,5836,5837,5838,5839,5840,5841,5842,5843,5844,5845,5846,5847,5848,5849,5850,5851,5852,5853,5854,5855,5856,5857,5858,5859,5860,5861,5862,5863,5864,5865,5866,5867,5868,5869,5870,5871,5872,5873,5874,5875,5876,5877,5878,5879,5880,5881,5882,5883,5884,5885,5886,5887,5888,5889,5890,5891,5892,5893,5894,5895,5896,5897,5898,5899,5900,5901,5902,5903,5904,5905,5906,5907,5908,5909,5910,5911,5912,5913,5914,5915,5916,5917,5918,5919,5920,5921,5922,5923,5924,5925,5926,5927,5928,5929,5930,5931,5932,5933,5934,5935,5936,5937,5938,5939,5940,5941,5942,5943,5944,5945,5946,5947,5948,5949,5950,5951,5952,5953,5954,5955,5958,5961,5962,5963,5964,5965,5966,5967,5968,5969,5970,5971,5972,5973,5974,5975,5976,5977,5978,5979,5980,5981,5982,5983,5984,5985,5986,5987,5988,5989,5990,5991,5992,5993,5994,5995,5996,5997,5998,5999,6000,6001,6002,6003],"revision_id":1775463},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-058-zhou-fang:p002:m0001","surface":"元帝","start":1,"end":3,"person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-058-zhou-fang:p002:m0016","surface":"訪","start":16,"end":17,"person_id":"c6b_s71_vt7","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-058-zhou-fang:p002:m0017","surface":"同姓名者","start":17,"end":21,"per